flowchart LR
    U[Client Request] --> ACA[Azure Container Apps]
    ACA --> APP[Spring Boot API]
    APP --> TRACE[Datadog Java Tracer]
    APP --> LOG[Structured Application Log]
    TRACE --> INIT[Datadog serverless-init]
    LOG --> INIT
    INIT --> DD[Datadog]
    DD --> LOGS[Log Explorer]
    DD --> APM[APM Service / Trace]
    DD --> LBM[Log-based Metric]
    LBM --> DASH[Dashboard]
    LBM --> MON[Monitor / Alert]
